# Auto push

After finishing any user-requested change in this repo:

1. Commit with author/committer **Mittansh Bhatia** `<mittanshbhatia@users.noreply.github.com>`
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (usually `main`) without waiting to be asked
3. Never add Cursor / AI attribution trailers
4. Skip only if there is nothing to commit, or the user explicitly says not to push
